window.products.push({"id":891210,"name":"Enchanting Scents Await: Satya Incense Gift Set + Free New Age Imports, Inc.® Burner| Nag Champa, Celestial Bliss, Midnight Bloom, Divine Blessing, Wh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717tTvvv-tL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Satya Sai Baba authentic hand-rolled Made in Bengaluru (BNG) Nag Champa Incense: Certified and authorized product, ensuring authenticity and quality. Hand-rolled in Bengaluru, India, following traditional methods. Nag Champa fragrance, renowned for its unique and captivating aroma. Incense Packs available in a variety of exquisite scents: Nag Champa: The classic and popular fragrance loved for its calming and spiritual properties. Celestial Bliss: A heavenly blend of scents that uplifts the mood and creates a serene atmosphere. Midnight Bloom: A captivating floral fragrance that brings a sense of enchantment and tranquility. Divine Blessing: An aromatic blend that promotes relaxation and a sense of divine presence. Golden Sunrise: A vibrant and energizing scent that revitalizes the senses and creates a positive ambiance. White Sage: Known for its purifying properties, this incense carries a refreshing and cleansing aroma. Dragon's Blood: A unique and mystical fragrance that adds an exotic touch to any space. Lavender: A soothing and calming scent that helps to relieve stress and promote relaxation. Each pack contains 15 grams of high-quality incense: Offers a generous amount of incense sticks for an extended period of use. Ensures a lasting and consistent fragrance experience with every stick. Incense Burner included: A 9-inch long incense burner for convenient and safe use. Provides a dedicated space for burning incense without any mess or damage to surfaces. Handrolled in India using natural extracts and traditional methods: The masala mix, made from natural extracts, is carefully formulated into a dough. Rolled by hand onto bamboo sticks, following ancient techniques for authentic craftsmanship. The result is a genuine and high-quality incense product. Satya: One of the most renowned incense brands worldwide: A trusted and respected brand known for its commitment to quality and craftsmanship. Satya incense products have a long-standing reputation for their captivating fragrances. Genuine and reliable product by New Age Imports, Inc: Ensures the authenticity and quality of the incense burner. New Age Imports, Inc. is a recognized distributor of high-quality incense products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717tTvvv-tL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"New Age Imports, Inc.","source_asin":"B0BHLDDN8T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-891210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHLDDN8T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHLDDN8T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
