window.products.push({"id":891222,"name":"Hat Rack Over The Door Baseball Cap Organizer for Wall Closet Organizers and Storage, 24 Large Pocket with Hooks Holds Up to 48 Caps, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c0-pAcfpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hat Rack Ideas – Rather of throwing your hats in the corner of the coat closet or losing them to a leading shelf in any or every space of the house, build yourself a hat rack to organize and show them nicely. DECLUTTER AND ORGANIZE: Have you ever make a particular room for storing hats? If not, it is better to stat right now. A baseball hat rack can be a great way of getting rid of clumps of your favorite caps from a closet. With AXYES baseball cap storage bags, you can organize them by colors, shapes, sizes, or uses. Now it's time to get a new hat rack to keep them all arranged and manageable. HOLDS UP TO 48 CAPS: AXYES cap organizer holds up to 48 caps and can be hung in your closet to keep it clean. The baseball cap rack fits all styles, including baseball caps, sun visors, fitted caps, adjustable caps, cowboy hats with binding ties. DIMENSIONS: 64.5\"L x 27.5\"W, each pocket measure 9\" in width and 7\" in height. 7\" deep pockets of the hat holder organizer to keep from falling out when the door opens and closes; EASY TO USE: A baseball hat rack is a great way to remove sloppy piles of your preferred caps in a closet. You can do it by creating storage for hats over a door or mounted on a wall. Our Cap Rack comes with 3 metal hooks that fit the thickness of normal closet door, bedroom door, and also contains 3 adhesive wall hooks. It holds up to numerous hats and mount directly onto a wall, door and closet. Easy installation with no tools required! The Perfect Gift for A Messy Hat Fanatic! - Know someone who leaves their hats all over the house? Our ball cap organizer is the ultimate solution to keep rooms neat and tidy without compromising space!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c0-pAcfpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AXYES","source_asin":"B09MH2FCNP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-891222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MH2FCNP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MH2FCNP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
