window.products.push({"id":891244,"name":"Wine Travel Carrier & Cooler Bag 2-bottle Wine Carrying Tote Picnic Cooler Two Bottle Water Drinks Beer Insulated Neoprene Hand Bag (1 Bottle, Black S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51w7g6nOUqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Specification: Material:3.5mm Neoprene Suitable:750ml wine/water bottle Size:15\"(Height)x 4.75\"(Length). Situation:Perfect for Dinner,Party,Picnic,Travel. Feature: 1.Our Wine tote is lightweight and soft yet strong and flexible. Your bottles wont fall out whether the bag falls over nor will they break, making this bag an excellent choice for transportation. It folds flat when not in use taking up little room. 2.Roomy and sturdy,this cool wine bottle tote is made of premium quality, 3.5mm neoprene material that is not only extremely durable, but stain resistant, as well! 3.keep your cold beverages chilled: boasting comfortable, easy grip handles that let you carry your wine bottle with ease, this gorgeous tote will keep any standard 750ml bottle (wine, water,liquor, sports drink, milk) chilled for longer, so you can enjoy them at the perfect temperature. 4.Protective and Lightweight Neoprene:This durable material will protect its contents from breakage, bumps.beverage a breeze. 5.This tote can carry your favorite Wine, Champagne, Water Bottles, Liquor Bottles, Glass Bottles, and much more! Soft and handy grip handles make transporting your favorite wine. Package Content: 1x One Bottle Wine Carrying Insulated Bag Q1: What's the material of the single wine tote? A: It is made up of neoprene durable material. Q2: Will the neoprene bottle holder carry 750ml wine bottle? A: Yes,they are perfectly suit for 750ml wine tote,drinks,milk,or any standard 7","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51w7g6nOUqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LogHog","source_asin":"B073WQ8XY3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-891244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073WQ8XY3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073WQ8XY3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":891245,"name":"Medfield, Massachusetts by George Inness, 30x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jj3er12nL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a farm landscape. With Images from over 8,000 collections and more than 29,000 artists, Bridgeman Art Library collection represents international museums, galleries and artists by providing a central source of fine art for image users.Every subject, concept, style and medium is represented: from the masterpieces of national museums to the hidden treasures of private collections.Bridgeman Art Library is the world's largest archive of fine art, cultural and historical stills and now footage available for licensing and reproduction. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jj3er12nL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00D0Z3VTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-891245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D0Z3VTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D0Z3VTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
