window.products.push({"id":891263,"name":"Rockrok Soil PH Meter, 3-in-1 Moisture Acidity Sunlight Tester Kit for Indoor Outdoor Garden Farm Plants Lawn Testing","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GWVOAPPgL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Features: *100% brand new and high quality. *Ideal and necessary tool for gardeners, vegetable and fruit growers, and all those who plant trees and grass. *This plant meter is a perfect tool to test the soil conditions ( Moisture/Light/PH) of fruits, flowers, vegetables, shrubs, etc. with high accuracy and easy operation. You can take good care of your plants. *Take the guess work out of your daily garden watering light and moisture. *Measures moisture at root level. *No battery required, simple and convenient to use. *Simply insert plant soil tester into the soil, switch to the setting you want to measure and read the scale. Works great for Works with house and garden plants. *To avoid damaging the electrode, please clean the electrode after each use, do not use in soil with stones and insert forcibly. *Scientifically accurate, easy-to-read scale indicator. Specifications: Moist readings range: 0DRY-10WET Light readings range: 0DARK-2000LIGHT PH readings range: 8ALKALIN-3.5ACIDIC Multifunctional: can test Moisture/Light/PH. Probe length: 18cm(Approx) Size: 10.2in x 2.3in x 1.4in(Approx) Color: Green Shape: Water droplets Material: Plastics and stainless metal. Quantity: 1PC Note: 1. Please allow 0-3cm error due to manual measurement. pls make sure you do not mind before you bid. 2. Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item. Thank you! 3. Design for testing soil ONLY. Do not touch the stone or hard rock soil, if the soil is too hard and dry, easy to damage the probes. 4. After using, need to clean and wipe the probes. Package includes: 1PC x 3 in 1 Garden Meter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GWVOAPPgL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rockrok","source_asin":"B073Z9J1J5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-891263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073Z9J1J5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073Z9J1J5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
