window.products.push({"id":891430,"name":"100 Pcs Air Fryer paper Liners - 6.3 Inch Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, Non-Stick Air Fryer Disposable Liners, Food-Grade Air Fryer Liners Disposa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hIQrdB40L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"About Our Air Fryer Paper Liners Disposable:◆ Environment-Friendly Materials:The paper air fryer liners round are made of pure wood and designed with a round bowl shape which doesn’t need to tear, fold, cut or bend, just take one piece and place it in the fryer to use. Its 1.8 inches edges prevent food from sticking to the sides. Baking parchment can withstand temperatures up to 450°F (230°C). The 40gsm thickness won’t easily tear when lifting after cooking.◆ Multipurpose Disposable Paper:Our Parchment paper sheets for baking is suitable for the air fryer, microwave, oven, steamer, cooker, etc. The paper liners can be applied for baking, roasting, frying, or serving food, suitable for home baking, camping, BBQ, summer party, and so on, lightweight and practical.◆ Non-stick & Easy to Clean:Our Air fryer disposable paper is silicone-coated on both sides that are water & oil resistant. The wall surrounding the air fryer paper liners round is designed to collect oil and food residue from cooking. You don’t have to face the messy oil and stains anymore after each use. Simplify your cleaning by adding our paper liner for air fryer basket. Simply take a piece and place it in the basket under the food to hold oil, glaze, and sauce on.◆ CAUTION:The parchment paper sheets for air fryer is only meant to withstand heat up to 450°F. Note! Make sure there’s food on the air fryer basket liner before you turn the machine on, otherwise the airfryer paper will blow to the top and may cause the air fryer paper liner to catch fire.◆ SPECIFICATION:Color: BrownQuantity: 100PcsMaterial: Raw WoodSize: 6.3inchsThickness: 40gsm◆ SATISFACTION GUARANTEED:We believe in the quality of our disposable air fryer liners and the satisfaction of customers is our first priority. If you have any issues please feel free to contact us to get good customer service support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hIQrdB40L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BBBMMM9G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-891430","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBBMMM9G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBBMMM9G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
