window.products.push({"id":891603,"name":"Robot Vacuum Self Emptying with Spin Mop, 3000pa Robot Vacuum and Mop Combo, Visual Navigation, Smart Mapping, Wi-Fi Connected, Compatible with Alexa,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":467.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xq-MWeB0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TIP: The A91+ is specifically designed to use only one side brush. [Deep Cleaning & Self-emptying Station]: With 3000Pa strong suction power and multi-surface brushroll, Amarey A91+ vacuum robot can pull up most of dirt, debris and pet hair from deep within your carpets and floors. Amarey A91+ self-emptying base sucks dirt from the dustbin into the 3L dust bag and holds up to 45 days to free you from frequent dustbin emptying. Note：A91+ only has one side brush. [Efficient Dual-spinning Mopping]: Amarey robot vacuum and mop combo adopts a dual-rotating mop design with downward pressure and a high speed rotation (180r/min), which can accelerate the removal of dirt and stains in crevices. The robot is equipped with ultrasonic carpet detection sensors, which allow the vacuum cleaner to avoid wetting the carpet when mopping. [Visual Navigation & 27 Sensitive Sensors]: Amarey A91+ robotic vacuum cleaner is smarter than ever, it adopts upgraded visual SLAM navigation to learn the layout of your home and build personal Smart Maps, enabling it to expertly clean and drive in orderly, back-and-forth rows. Built-in 27 sensitive sensors can detect the furniture environment in real time during work, judge the surrounding objects in its path, accurately detect the objects in front, and decelerate within 10cm in advance. [App & Voice Control]: Schedule your cleaning, set up a virtual boundary and No-Go Zone, or chose a specific room to clean anywhere at any time through the \"Amarey Bot\" App connected with 2.4 Ghz Wi-Fi. Voice control with Amazon Alexa and Siri enables you to free your hand completely and start your smart life! [Perfect Gifts & Ideal for Homes with Pets]: Combined with ultra strong sution power, high-Efficiency filter and a multi-surface brush roll that won't tangle with pet hair, Amarey robotic vacum cleaner captures dust, lint and 99% of cat and dog dander dirt, pet hair efficiently. It is a perfect gift for the one who you are really care to free them out of the mess housework and live an easy and happy life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xq-MWeB0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"amarey","source_asin":"B0BNQCR9W7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-891603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNQCR9W7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNQCR9W7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
