window.products.push({"id":891709,"name":"Best French Press Coffee Maker with Unique Filter System and Bonus - Brewing the Most Delicious Drink -- 1 Liter, 34 Ounce, 8 Cups/4 Mugs -- 2mm Thick","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aeWFan2sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE ONLY POT using this INNOVATIVE DESIGN of Specific Filter System - 3-part stainless steel mesh filter (NO PBA) and additional extra strainer in the lid. NO MORE GROUNDS FLOATING IN YOUR BEAKER OF COFFEE!!! As a BONUS you receive special eBook with useful information and special recipes. PREMIUM QUALITY, NOTHING LESS!! MarkusR Coffeepot & Tea-maker is made of 2mm thick heat resistant glass and metal for maximum durability. What's so special about this Borosilicate Glass? This is the only type of glass conceived to resist at thermal shocks, it will never crack! Incomparable design and high quality craftsmanship. EASY TO USE - TRULY THE BEST CUP OF COFFEE - MarkusR coffee-press brews the perfect coffee/tea in just few minutes. SAVE TIME!! Best choice for busy people! SAY GOODBYE TO PAPER FILTERS and Plastic K-Cups! Specific filter system helps extract your coffee's aromatic oil and subtle flavors. Two pouring options - \"closed\" to let coffee steep and \"open\" with an additional strainer. EASY TO CLEAN - The MarkusR coffee pottle is cleverly designed for easy removal of sturdy glass coffee kettle from metal frame for quick cleaning and upkeep. All parts are easily disassembled including strainer and plunger assembly. SUPER PRESENT for all Coffee and Tea Lovers. Good for Iced Coffee. Best for preparing coffee, hot chocolate, fruit infusions, lemonades & more. Look attractive in kitchen and office; Great Wedding, House warming, retirement and birthday present for ALL Coffee Lovers. Buy with confidence. The most important driving factor for us remains the customer and his satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aeWFan2sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Markus Reichenberger","source_asin":"B017PD5D5G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-891709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017PD5D5G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017PD5D5G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
