window.products.push({"id":891729,"name":"Hey Girl Tea Cup with Infuser and Lid - Double-Walled Insulation & Ceramic Outer Tea Infuser Mug - Fine-Mesh Strainer Basket - Gorgeous Design & Insid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+at8ZWeXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A PERFECT CUPPA: This gorgeous tea infuser mug is the ideal vessel for your favorite tea, a hot, soothing brew that lifts your spirits and makes every wrong thing right again. Any tea junkie knows that the perfect cup of tea isn’t just about flavor and aroma. It’s a soul-inspired moment that lasts until the final sip, and it demands the right tea cup with lid! HOT UNTIL THE LAST DROP: Fed up with your tea mug that doesn't do its job? How about a ceramic tea cup with infuser and lid that actually keeps your tea hot and free of loose leaf residue? Sign me up, said every tea lover on the planet! This tea cup with infuser has a stainless steel fine mesh strainer, double-walled interior, and well-designed lid that insulates your tea and saves you from a lukewarm lacklustre brew. And the cool ceramic outer won’t scald your hands. DESIGNED WITH LOVE: Ditch the boring tea cup and grab a tea mug with infuser that is made for those soul-saving, self-affirming moments. Golden heart design adds a touch of elegance and the sweet message inside the cup is etched in an elegant script that wraps you in self love every time you take a sip. No other tea cups for women deliver this kind of love! A WARM HUG FOR YOUR GF: For that beautiful tea-lover lady in your life. This tea mug with infuser and lid shows your bestie, mom, aunt, sister, or daughter just how much she’s adored. With a loving design, positive affirmation, and elegant packaging, this unique tea infuser cup puts a special and personal spin on tea accessories gifts for women, unlike any other. 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE: You know what you want, that’s why you choose your products with intention and discrimination. We want to make sure you’re 100% happy with your Hey Girl Tea Infuser Mug. If it doesn’t meet your standards for quality and style, just let us know and we’ll give you a full refund, no questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+at8ZWeXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hey Girl Tea","source_asin":"B08RHG7RND","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-891729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RHG7RND","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RHG7RND","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
