window.products.push({"id":891737,"name":"Pan Organizer Rack - Kitchen Closet Storage for Pots, Pans and Lids - Holds Up to 8 Items - Easy Screw or Adhesive Installation - by Bovado USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X-mi-Q9lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Love to cook up a storm but dread the clutter created by all the pots and pans? Fear no more! This Organizer Rack for Cookware is your solution. Use it to dry your pans after washing or to streamline organization in your kitchen cabinets. Built of strong metal with five “shelves, it has the capacity to hold two 2 14 inch pans and three 9 inch pans, or six large lids and two pans. No matter its specific use in your kitchen, it will prove to be a practical, versatile accessory. It also makes the perfect practical present for a friend or family member who loves to cook. PRODUCT FEATURES: Dimensions: 9.4 x 11.8 x 10 inches Made of Metal Black Easy to Install with Adhesives or Screws Capacity to Accommodate: - 6 Large Lids and 2 Pans- Two 14 Inch Pans and three 9 Inch Pans Easy to Clean Makes a Great Gift PROTECT YOUR PANS Tired of your pots and pans banging and clattering every time you take them out to cook? Now this Organizer Rack for Cookware by Bovado can help you avoid this annoying noise while also keeping your cookware in tip top shape. Stack your pans on the “shelves” of this rack and keep them scratch-free, whether you use this piece as a drying rack after washing the dishes or as a storage unit in your kitchen cabinet. Built of a strong metal material, this organizer rack is durable and able to withstand heavy pots and pans while also keeping them in good shape for long-lasting use. It’s a win-win situation! KEEP A CLUTTER-FREE KITCHEN Now you can whip up your favorite foods using pots and pans galore while still keeping your kitchen clean and clutter-free. Stack your pots, pans, and lids onto this convenient rack, and you’ll create extra storage space in your kitchen while clearing up clutter. Easy to install with screws or adhesives, it will fit right in your kitchen. Eliminate clutter from your kitchen counters, cabinets, and pantries!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X-mi-Q9lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOVADO USA","source_asin":"B06XD585HJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-891737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XD585HJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XD585HJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
