window.products.push({"id":891869,"name":"ADK Market Basket (Black Ogee) Multifunctional Durable Structured Market Basket/Reusable Shopping Bag That Folds Flat/Holds 30 lbs.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZRd71D1FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"While others crumble, we stand tall, and so do our bags. Inspired by a 150 year old design, ADK Packworks has created a new semi-rigid, lightweight, internal frame that folds easily for storage and stays upright. The ADK Market Basket is equipped with a sturdy design and unmatched style. With a built-in metal frame and a solid plastic bottom, it provides the solution to all your carrying needs. The Market Basket has a large capacity to carry all of your items without being bulky and overweight. Its sturdy fabric and metal frame structure are stronger than traditional plastic grocery bags and reusable bags. From taking it to the grocery store to your local farmer’s market, the beach, or a family picnic, the ADK Market Basket can go anywhere!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZRd71D1FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ADK Packworks","source_asin":"B0117VM6SO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-891869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0117VM6SO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0117VM6SO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
