window.products.push({"id":891878,"name":"Advent Calendar 2023 - Boys Fidget Christmas Countdown Calendar - Reusable 24 Days Surprises Sensory Toys - Holiday Xmas Count Down Gifts for Kids Tod","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NQ8pqwy-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FIDGET ADVENT CALENDAR FOR 2023 --- Our Advent Calendar is designed for 24 cute small boxes, Gifts is packged in an different exquisite little box, make sure your kids have 24 days memoroable surprise.So they can harvest different joyness from December 1st to December 24th. A unique way for your little ones to count down the days throughout Advent until Christmas Day. VALUE CHRISTMAS SET --- This advent calendar gift box includes varieties stunning gifts: take apart dinosour*1, Christmas push bubble* 2, mochi squishies*5, maze puzzle*1, football spinner*1, squeeze grape ball*1, wind-up toys*1, bubble bracelet*1, guess game toys*2, wall tumbler sticky*3, unicorn bracelet*2, bouncing villain*2, Christmas slap bracelet*3, sensory ring*5, stretchy string*4, Christmas infinity*1, finger monster toys*3, launch chicken*2, heart-shaped maze*1, wacky tracks*2. CHILD-SAFE MATERIAL --- This advent calendar 2023 is made of high quality plastic, non-toxic, suitable for adults and children, contains funny and fidget toys, like maze puzzle, push bubble fideget bracelet and Squeezable snowman that relieve stress. REUSABLE CHRISTMAS CALENDAR --- The thick and sturdy advent calendar if handled with care, are durable enough to be reused for many upcoming years. Next year, Parent can DIY a meaningful advent calendar for your child. Of course, kids also can filled it with toys and then as a gift for their friends. GIFTS FOR ALL AGES --- This fidget toy pack is a great desk accessory for kids and adults. No more getting distracted for hours, it allows you a break and helps you get back on track quickly. Perfect for Party Favors, Christmas Party, Christmas Gift for Kids and More!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NQ8pqwy-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SQZUWIT","source_asin":"B0B4BKZRY1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-891878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4BKZRY1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4BKZRY1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
